export fn longestpalindrome(v:[*]const i64,n:usize)i64{if(n<1 or n>65)return -1;const count=v[0];if(count<0 or count>64 or n!=@as(usize,@intCast(count))+1)return -1;var a:[64]i64=@splat(0);var m:usize=0;for(0..@as(usize,@intCast(count)))|i|{const x=v[i+1];if(x<32 or x>126 or x==35)return -1;if(x!=32){a[m]=x;m+=1;}}const z=2*m+1;var t:[129]i64=@splat(0);for(0..z)|i|{if(i%2==0){t[i]= -1;}else{t[i]=a[i/2];}}var p:[129]usize=@splat(0);var center:usize=0;var right:usize=0;var best:usize=0;for(0..z)|i|{if(i<right){p[i]=@min(p[2*center-i],right-i);}while(i>=p[i]+1 and i+p[i]+1<z and t[i-p[i]-1]==t[i+p[i]+1]){p[i]+=1;}best=@max(best,p[i]);if(i+p[i]>right){center=i;right=i+p[i];}}return @intCast(best);}
